Wait, in iso-lumps-off, the cluster is black, and there are also thin black stalks (kelp/whip) plus some stalks with leaf shapes at left. The tubes are the 5 cylinder blocks.

So why black? Let's check drawTubeLocal's color param: `const color = mixColor(pal.coral[plant.hue % pal.coral.length], pal.rim, 0.08);`

`pal` here = r.palFor(obj.zone) = ZONES[0].palette. coral = ['#ff9a72',...]. plant.hue = rng.int(0, len-1) → 0-4. So salmon-ish.

